main.no_tui = This build does not include the terminal interface. Build with LONELYICE_TUI=ON, or use --pkg and --headless.
main.usage = LonelyIce\n  --tui, -nw, --nw   Terminal setup and configuration\n  --headless         Run the configured server in the foreground\n  --server           Low-level server mode\n  --pkg              Plugin package manager\n  --backup           Backups\n  --tool             Game data tools\n  --help             Show this help\nGUI, TUI, headless, package and backup modes accept --settings <profile.yaml>.\nWithout a mode: graphical launcher when built, otherwise the terminal interface.
